  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN250.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṟkuk kuṟai nērnta tōḻi talaimakaṭkuk kuṟai nayappa kūṟiyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">How, the confidante who had granted HIS request, spoke to HER so that she would agree to the request[, too].</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN250.1">
        <l>evaṉkol vāḻi tōḻi mayaṅkupitir</l>
        <l>malkutirai yuḻanta volkunilaip puṉṉai</l>
        <l>vaṇṭimi riṇara nuṇṭātu varippa</l>
        <l>maṇaṅkama ḻiḷamaṇa lekkark kāṇvarak</l>
        <l>kaṇaṅko ḷāyamoṭu puṇarntuviḷai yāṭak</l>
        <l>koṭuñci neṭuntē riḷaiya<supplied>ro</supplied>ṭu nīkkit</l>
        <l>tāraṉ kaṇṇiyaṉ cēravan toruvaṉ</l>
        <l>varimaṉai pukaḻnta kiḷaviyaṉ yā<supplied>va</supplied>tu</l>
        <l>maṟumoḻi peṟā<supplied>a</supplied>ṉ peyarntaṉa ṉa<supplied>ta</supplied>ṟkoṇ</l>
        <l>ṭarumpaṭa revvamoṭu peruntōḷ cāa</l>
        <l>yavvalaip paratavar kāṉalañ ciṟukuṭi</l>
        <l>vevvāyp peṇṭir ka<supplied>vvai</supplied>yiṟ <anchor n="1"/>kalaṅki</l>
        <l>yiṟaivaḷai nekiḻnta nammoṭu</l>
        <l>tuṟaiyun tuñcātu kaṅku lāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1a-c">What [is this], oh friend?</l>
        <l corresp="3">When [we] were drawing with the fine pollen from clusters on which bees were humming</l>
        <l corresp="1d-2">of the Puṉṉai tree with weakened base that bore the increasing waves with diffuse spray,</l>
        <l corresp="4">when [we] came to see the dunes of fresh sand fragrant with scent,</l>
        <l corresp="5">when [we] were playing, united with [our play] mates in a group,</l>
        <l corresp="7">someone came to join [us], one with a chaplet [and] a garland,</l>
        <l corresp="6">leaving [his] tall chariot with a support staff with [his] attendants,</l>
        <l corresp="8a-c">[and] had words of praise for [our out-]lined houses,</l>
        <l corresp="8c-9c">[and then] he went [back] without having obtained any word in exchange.</l>
        <l corresp="9d">Upon taking [this] in,</l>
        <l corresp="10">[our] wide shoulders are emaciated with the trouble of affliction difficult [to bear],</l>
        <l corresp="12">[and we] are stirred by scandalous [talk] from cruel-mouthed women</l>
        <l corresp="11">from the small hamlet by the seashore grove of the fishermen with pretty nets,</l>
        <l corresp="13">[and] along with us whose bangles have become loose on [our] joints,</l>
        <l corresp="14">the ghat too doesn’t sleep at night.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

